-3-WLLKZGPU.svg" style=3D"color: transparent;"></div></figure>
<p>From this high-level overview, we can summarize operations we need to im=
plement the <code>put</code> function:</p>
<ol>
<li>
<p>Remove a key-value pair from the least recently used end of the cache.</=
p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Add a key-value pair to the most recently used end of the cache.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr>
<p>Now, let's try retrieving a value from this example cache. If we perform=
 <code>get(2)</code>, we expect it to return 250. Accessing this pair would=
 effectively make it the most recently used pair. So, we should move it to =
the most recently used end of the cache:</p>
