<p>From this example, we identified two key operations for the <code>get</c=
ode> function:</p>
<ol start=3D"3">
<li>
<p>Move a key-value pair to the most recent end of the cache.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Access a value using its key.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr>
<p>We=E2=80=99ve now narrowed the design down to the four main operations l=
isted above. These will help us identify which data structures we can emplo=
y to design the LRU cache.</p>
